    {
      "box": [
        87.10240936279297,
        181.40342712402344,
        423.1304931640625,
        192.2120361328125
      ],
      "text": "A\n_Itgives a highly original explanation for urban development.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.46234893798828,
        195.08067321777344,
        519.4473876953125,
        234.68382263183594
      ],
      "text": "B-\nElements of Barr’s research papers are incorporated throughout the book.\nC\nOther books that are available on the subject have taken a different approach.\nD_\nIt covers a range of factors that affected the development of New York.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.18764877319336,
        244.7506561279297,
        483.0044860839844,
        255.91954040527344
      ],
      "text": "28\nHow does Shester respond to the information in the book about tenements?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.1024398803711,
        266.7062072753906,
        348.49627685546875,
        275.3531188964844
      ],
      "text": "A\nShe describes the reasons for Barr’s interest.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.4623794555664,
        280.38348388671875,
        413.9165344238281,
        305.229248046875
      ],
      "text": "B__\nShe indicates a potential problem with Barr’s analysis.\nC\nShe compares Barr’s conclusion with that of other writers.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.82229614257812,
        308.8177795410156,
        458.169677734375,
        319.62640380859375
      ],
      "text": "D_\nShe provides details about the sources Barr used for his research.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.187679290771484,
        330.053466796875,
        370.45538330078125,
        341.2223815917969
      ],
      "text": "29\nWhat does Shester say about chapter six of the book?\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.10247039794922,
        350.2093811035156,
        316.6498107910156,
        402.7674255371094
      ],
      "text": "A__\nlt contains conflicting data.\nB __\nIt focuses too much on possible trends.\nC_Itis too specialised for most readers.\nD\nIt draws on research that is out of date.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        61.54765319824219,
        415.35626220703125,
        495.93701171875,
        438.0403137207031
      ],
      "text": "30\nWhat does Shester suggest about the chapters focusing on the 1920s building\nboom?\n"
    },
    {
