        449.5494079589844,
        401.9454040527344,
        463.6006164550781
      ],
      "text": "A__ The information should have been organised differently.\n"
    },
    {
      "box": [
        87.82235717773438,
        465.0262451171875,
        449.7655944824219,
        475.83489990234375
      ],
      "text": "B-\nMore facts are needed about the way construction was financed.\n"
